    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>歡迎大家收聽新一期W 野狗播客，可以添加小野狗微信：Wwilddog001，加入我們的社群。也可以關注我們的公眾號：W 和創造者們、W 野狗的野島，獲取更多資訊～</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline🕗</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> 藝術人轉行賣大碴粥❓</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> 我在賣大碴粥裡是最懂藝術的😁</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 生意與人的藝術連接是從哪一刻開始的🔗</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 交換關係在藝術中處於什麼位置💰</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 在「吃」的過程中獲得自我體驗💞</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a> 自己盛的阿姨和沒零錢的大爺🧍‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 每天都有故事發生，這不就是生活嗎☁️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 買賣關係是一時的，裡面卻藏著小心思🤏</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a> 橫跨結冰的江面去賣粥 🛺</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 你無法否認普通人的靈光乍現⚡️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a> 我想把我的粥送給需要喝粥的人🥣</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a> 您怎麼看待最近東北文藝復興🥶</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">32:09</a> 不要只通過社交媒體了解東北🙅</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 我在做食物的新生和食物的遊牧🐑</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 大碴粥整合店即將上線🥳</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 外賣不是買賣而是一種傳播方式📣</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 商業是藝術的嫁接而非結合❌</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> 藝術表達是先有雞還是先有蛋 🥚</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 藝術從來沒有和商業完全分離‼️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 食物是文化的載體 🍜</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2831">47:11</a> 我想讓更多人通過食物了解自己❤️‍🔥</span></p>]]></description>
