    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感謝大家收聽～歡迎關注我們的公眾號：W 和創造者們&amp;W 野狗的野島，添加小野狗微信：Wwilddog001，進入播客社群喔～🎉🎉祝大家週末快樂～</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline🕗</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 衣品是衣服說話的一種狀態🥳</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 衣服說：別來打擾我🙅</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 樸素的單品也能穿出自己的感覺✔️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 服裝本身包裹住的人是最重要的💪</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 穿不符合自己氣質的衣服就像在角色扮演🎬</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 什麼樣的衣服穿搭「好說話」❓</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 材料是衣服說話的方式之一🤨</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="969">16:09</a> 找到為自己說話的衣服是很漫長的</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 服裝本身有社交屬性💭</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 拉開衣櫃，不同的自己掛在那裡👔</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> 不同的單品在交戰，自己卻變成了啞巴😠</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 我用衣服和想說話的人說話📖</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 好看的衣服會幫自己說話😄</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> 不管你是誰，我就是應該很漂亮😻</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 如何從衣服的語言裡找到自信🤔</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2712">45:12</a> 衣服和人一樣需要被認真對待💞</span></p>]]></description>
