    <title>向宇宙下訂單的48小時後，我找到了人生作弊器 by W 野狗播客</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dd335edd11f9c8c1314753</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dd335edd11f9c8c1314753</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Mar 2025 09:44:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>歡迎添加小野狗微信：Wwilddog001，進入播客社群喔</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以關注公眾號：W和創造者們、W野狗的野島</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline🕗</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 顯化不是能量轉化，而是對事物發展的判斷✍️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 我用顯化讓前任回頭，現在我們結婚啦🎎</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> 顯化和王陽明的知行合一是相通的🟰</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 顯化減少了我的內耗🥹</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> 玄學的重點是行動</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> 願望只要寫下來就會實現✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 與玄學相關的事物，都要抱有一顆平常心💓</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 玄學是情緒堵塞的疏通口🚪</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 正向暗示讓我的職場進入正向循環♻️</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 我從高敏感人到現在的知行合一😄</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 顯化讓我看見創傷，對媽媽有了包容🈶</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a> 因為顯化，我看見了自己的成長卡點🙅</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 情感最濃的時候，顯化效果是最強的💪</span></p><span></span><p><span>➔ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> 情緒和書籍是顯化成功的關鍵🔑</span></p>]]></description>
